## 2. Strategic policy (rmw3, S5)

> **"VSF debe ser completamente funcional de manera interna antes de integrar módulos S1."**
> — rmw3, 2026-05-25 evening

Consequences:
- **W2 (BBH-as-S1 integration) DEFERRED** until VSF internal completeness ≥ 7.5/10
- BBH publisher contract (`docs/operational/bbh_publisher_contract.md`) stays delivered, no timeline pressure
- Focus shifts to **Tier α internal hardening**

Captured in memory: `feedback_internal_first_before_s1.md`.

## 3. Three-tier plan

```
Tier α — Internal hardening    (target 7.5/10) ← CURRENT FOCUS
Tier β — Internal validation   (target 8.0/10)
Tier γ — S1 integration        (deferred, depends BBH side AND α+β done)
```

