### Phase 4 — Path to 7.5/10 (Qwen-locked 2026-05-27)

Derived from `docs/sessions/briefs/qwen_response_phase1_2_3_vsl_2026-05-27.md`.
Current baseline: 7.0/10 (with footnote: +0.2 contingent on BRECHA-1 closure).

| Step | Item | Effort | Lifts |
