| **4.5** | vsf-agent Rust common library (Option_x / Q10) | Tier β | scalability |

After 4.1+4.2+4.3+4.4: **VSM score → ~7.5/10** (Qwen-validated path).
After 4.5: scaling foundation for adding more consumer agents safely.

### Phase 4-FIX — Restore operational viability (Qwen honest audit 2026-05-29)

Phase 4 reached **structural 7.5/10** but honest audit found **functional 6.6/10**.
Three operational failures (organs built, not metabolizing):

| Fix | Issue | Effort | Restores |
|---|---|---|---|
| **fix_1** | s3-star daemon never cycles (Poisson rate 0.01/24h = 100-day mean) | 30min | S3* 4.5→6 |
| **fix_2** | NATS subscribers die silently (bbs-bridge dead 2.5d) | 2h/agent | BRECHA-5/6 degraded→closed |
| **fix_3** | invariant_check samples=0 (sensors unconnected) | 2h | Variety 5→7 |

Qwen verdict: all Tier α 'must'. Sequence fix_1 → fix_2 → fix_3.
**S1/BBH integration ON HOLD until fix_1 + fix_2 complete** (else BBH inherits
dormant S3* + deaf bridge → amplifies dysfunction).

Tasks: #107, #108, #109.

