## 8. Paper / experiments

Paper `attractor_convergence` v0.6 (35pp, validated Fierro UV 2026-05-01) is
**on stand-by** until Tier α complete. Reason: paper claims rest on operational
VSF; today VSF has known gaps (S3*=2/10). Closing α makes the claims more
defensible.

